Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,Main,0,0,0,,---- Main ----
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.46,0:00:18.24,Top,Game,0,0,0,,K.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.48,0:00:21.67,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,太… 太強了…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:24.66,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,沒想到前輩竟然會三連敗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.06,0:00:28.80,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那位客人應該是常客之中最強的才對
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:31.05,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,竟然會三連敗…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.05,0:00:32.53,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,到底是何方神…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.61,0:00:36.18,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,女… 女孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.35,0:00:38.92,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,而且年紀看起來跟莉莉差不多…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:42.56,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,不好意思 可以再跟我打一場嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.94,0:00:44.18,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.53,0:00:47.15,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我已經決定好下一個對手了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:00:56.46,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,要不要跟我打一場啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.46,0:00:58.38,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我… 我嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.77,0:02:32.87,Top,Renji,0,0,0,,我… 我嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:35.38,Top,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,跟… 跟店員打嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:37.21,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,為… 為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.93,0:02:41.85,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,還問我為什麼啊 小哥你也太無情了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.85,0:02:46.23,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,小時候明明玩弄了我的少女心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.49,0:02:47.42,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.42,0:02:49.13,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,店員小哥竟然從以前就…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.15,0:02:51.40,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不是… 我根本沒印象啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:53.03,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,那件事我可忘不了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.03,0:02:56.23,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,小學時為了炫耀在家用主機練好的連招
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.23,0:02:59.11,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,而開始跑遊樂場的日子…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:02.12,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,現在那種小學生很少見了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:04.50,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我的遊樂場初登場
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.50,0:03:06.93,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,可是連戰連勝 狀態絕佳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.65,0:03:08.74,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,沒錯…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.11,0:03:11.65,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,在你亂入進來之前都是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.79,0:03:14.88,FlashbackTop,Game,0,0,0,,Perfect K.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.52,0:03:19.37,FlashbackTop,Game,0,0,0,,You Lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.27,0:03:28.01,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,被完封慘敗的那份屈辱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.81,0:03:32.39,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我這輩子都忘不了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.03,0:03:35.91,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.22,0:03:37.64,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我不記得了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.64,0:03:39.53,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,那件事成了我的心理創傷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.53,0:03:42.23,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,害我之後都窩在網路對戰裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.23,0:03:43.63,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,那樣太過分了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.63,0:03:45.95,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,換作是我一輩子都不敢玩格鬥遊戲了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.95,0:03:47.22,Text,Random,0,0,0,,太差勁了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:48.11,Text,Random,0,0,0,,太扯了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.11,0:03:49.25,Text,Random,0,0,0,,這個人渣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:50.28,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,有那麼嚴重嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:54.05,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,不過那段屈辱的日子也到今天為止了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.28,0:03:57.92,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,因為我已經用家用主機修行了各種遊戲！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:04:01.92,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,來吧 小哥 和我堂堂正正地一決勝負！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:04.26,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳突然這麼說…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.26,0:04:06.06,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我現在還在打工啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.06,0:04:08.76,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,那就現在立刻辭掉打工跟我打
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.76,0:04:10.64,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳在胡說八道什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:12.85,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,少囉哩叭唆的 快點跟我…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.87,0:04:13.60,High,Lily,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.87,0:04:13.60,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.39,0:04:15.63,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:19.18,High,Lily,0,0,0,,由我來當妳的對手！
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.02,0:04:19.18,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll be your opponent instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.18,0:04:21.45,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,蛤？ 妳誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.45,0:04:23.19,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,是莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.19,0:04:24.70,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,是莉莉耶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.10,0:04:26.30,Text,Random,0,0,0,,是莉莉耶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:28.00,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,怎麼了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.00,0:04:31.01,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,那些像是常客的傢伙突然騷動起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.36,0:04:32.59,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,難不成這傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.59,0:04:35.77,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,是這間遊樂場的第二把交椅？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.87,0:04:37.79,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我會保護蓮司！
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.87,0:04:37.79,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll protect Renji!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.83,0:04:42.26,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,也就是說沒辦法直接挑戰第一名是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.26,0:04:46.09,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,好啊 我就用妳喜歡的遊戲跟妳一決勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.51,0:04:51.09,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,那麼… 就用那個決勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:52.59,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,什…！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.93,0:04:54.91,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,男子漢無尾熊戰士
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.91,0:04:56.59,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,通稱 OKF
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.98,0:04:59.74,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,是還沒推出家用主機版的新作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.74,0:05:02.11,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,所以我還沒練習過
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.11,0:05:03.66,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,這個表情…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.66,0:05:05.72,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,看來她鑽研得相當深
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:08.23,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,不打嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.92,0:05:12.74,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,好啊 就用這個一決勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:16.58,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,不管是什麼遊戲…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.01,0:05:18.41,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,來吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.41,0:05:19.88,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,放馬過來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:21.14,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我已經…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:22.12,Top,Game,0,0,0,,Fight！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.49,0:05:23.88,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,不會再輸給任何人了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.81,0:05:28.27,Top,Game,0,0,0,,K.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:29.58,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,好弱！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.58,0:05:31.01,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,果然…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.01,0:05:32.65,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,什麼啊這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.65,0:05:34.22,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,根本就只是個門外漢嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.35,0:05:35.89,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,竟敢耍我…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:42.49,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,這傢伙… 真的哭了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:50.24,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,真是的 拿妳沒辦法耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:53.11,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我來教妳格鬥遊戲的基礎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.28,0:05:55.31,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.31,0:05:57.38,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我說我會好好鍛鍊妳啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.74,0:05:59.74,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,畢竟妳都懊悔到哭了 對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.08,0:06:01.30,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:04.00,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,那先跟電腦打練習吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:06.26,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,玩家對戰對妳來說還太早了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.26,0:06:08.01,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我… 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.01,0:06:10.25,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,感覺主旨變了耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.25,0:06:12.79,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,首先從丟招和防禦開始學
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.79,0:06:13.59,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.91,0:06:17.98,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,莉莉沒什麼一起玩的同齡朋友…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:19.31,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,真是太好了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.76,0:06:20.77,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是喔…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.77,0:06:22.73,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,改掉妳亂搖搖桿的習慣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.73,0:06:23.89,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.57,0:06:26.66,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嗯… 說的也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.82,0:06:29.03,Top,Game,0,0,0,,K.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.03,0:06:30.82,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,哦哦哦哦哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:33.17,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉打贏電腦了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.17,0:06:35.03,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,你們太吵了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.03,0:06:36.58,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,贏了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:40.53,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,謝… 謝謝妳 師父
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:43.23,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,師… 師父！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:47.68,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我… 我叫加賀花梨…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.68,0:06:50.35,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,哇 好開心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.35,0:06:52.31,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,她根本沒在聽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.31,0:06:54.30,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,妳好厲害喔 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:55.87,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.80,0:07:00.49,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,鬥志都被她搞沒了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.60,0:07:08.58,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,別忘了我教妳的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.58,0:07:10.49,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯 我會加油的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.49,0:07:13.32,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,跟小哥的決鬥就下次再說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.67,0:07:16.70,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.07,0:07:19.26,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,掰掰 師父
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.35,0:07:23.58,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,雖然我滿腦子都只想著要對戰取勝…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.53,0:07:28.83,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,偶爾這樣也不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.83,0:07:31.43,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,但應該不會再見面了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.48,0:07:38.05,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哦 還發生了那種事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.05,0:07:38.85,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.85,0:07:43.20,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,是說 那個店員先生打遊戲那麼強啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.20,0:07:46.85,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,跟我哥比的話 不知道誰比較強…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.85,0:07:49.29,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好想再見到師父
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.29,0:07:51.61,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,希望她今天也會在遊樂場呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.87,0:07:54.11,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.11,0:07:54.95,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.46,0:07:57.11,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,師父！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.48,0:07:57.11,Top,Aoi,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.11,0:07:59.61,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,原來我們念同一間學校喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.02,0:08:03.36,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,師父
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:06.55,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,師父
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:09.92,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,師父
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.65,0:08:12.05,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,給我適可而止
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.05,0:08:14.13,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,不准再一直叫我師父
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.85,0:08:19.39,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,師父…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:24.82,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,莉莉同學… 跟那個人的關係不太融洽嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.64,0:08:30.02,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,這種時候 班長就該挺身幫助同學
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.02,0:08:32.91,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我也稍微會說英文了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.91,0:08:35.59,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,現在的我 應該能幫上她的忙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.00,0:08:36.78,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.02,0:08:38.08,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,莉莉同學
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:40.04,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,需… 需要幫忙…
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.08,0:08:40.04,Text-English,Hotaru,0,0,0,,May… May I help...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.47,0:08:42.93,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,嗎…
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.47,0:08:42.93,Text-English,Hotaru,0,0,0,,you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.49,0:08:53.54,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,喂 妳們幹嘛跟著我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:57.01,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,沒辦法啊 我們的目的地一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.01,0:08:58.31,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.31,0:09:01.18,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,莉莉說想跟妳一起玩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.03,0:09:05.57,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,不好意思 恕我拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:09.06,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我是來找那個小哥做個了斷的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.06,0:09:12.43,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,聽說昨天他在打工所以拒絕妳了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.43,0:09:15.87,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,所以我才要叫他辭掉打工跟我對決
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.87,0:09:17.70,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳在說什麼傻話啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:20.69,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,但他現在好像不在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.69,0:09:23.46,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,那我就邊打發時間邊等他來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.46,0:09:25.95,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那在他來之前跟我們玩一下也好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:27.34,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.33,0:09:30.62,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,妳這傢伙在幹嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.24,0:09:33.47,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,一…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.23,0:09:36.89,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,起… 玩吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.71,0:09:44.15,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我先說好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.15,0:09:46.48,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我只陪妳們到那個小哥來為止
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:48.84,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,好好 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.88,0:09:51.13,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,玩這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:53.71,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,是夾零食的機台耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.71,0:09:55.90,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,零食直接用買的不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.90,0:09:57.74,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳在說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.74,0:10:01.63,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這是讓人期待「說不定能夾到很多」的遊戲耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.63,0:10:05.32,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,但夾到不喜歡吃的會覺得很虧耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.32,0:10:08.76,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,到時跟朋友換不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.99,0:10:10.59,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,真是個樂觀的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.59,0:10:12.09,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.09,0:10:14.35,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,她已經在玩了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.67,0:10:17.17,High,Lily,0,0,0,,妳看！ 中了！
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.67,0:10:17.17,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Look! I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.32,0:10:19.34,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,恭喜妳
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.34,0:10:22.71,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,雖然以金額來說是血虧…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.71,0:10:25.91,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,但說出來就跟加賀同學沒兩樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.91,0:10:27.47,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,奇怪 加賀同學呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.79,0:10:33.98,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,夾到超多
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.98,0:10:35.12,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:37.00,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,真不愧是師父
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.00,0:10:40.12,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳真的很會玩遊戲耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:43.00,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我只是瞄準快要崩塌的塔而已
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.86,0:10:47.07,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,想吃就儘管拿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.07,0:10:48.25,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.25,0:10:50.21,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,可是這樣有點…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.21,0:10:52.09,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,畢竟這是妳花錢夾的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.30,0:10:54.33,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我一個人也吃不完
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.59,0:10:55.83,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.83,0:10:59.37,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,妳們夾到其他零食再分我就好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.35,0:11:07.18,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那… 如果是交換的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.59,0:11:09.63,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,這個也能拿嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.63,0:11:10.16,Top,Karin,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.16,0:11:11.35,Top,Aoi,0,0,0,,謝謝 那我就不客氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.55,0:11:13.73,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,今天看起來也很開心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.73,0:11:14.56,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.13,0:11:18.21,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,好險
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.45,0:11:21.94,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,在被葵衣發現前得快點變裝才行！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.35,0:11:23.66,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這樣就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.66,0:11:25.82,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,喂 小哥 你在幹嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:31.20,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這孩子是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.20,0:11:33.63,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不對… 我已經變裝了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.63,0:11:36.22,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,應該不會再被她要求決勝負了吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.67,0:11:40.46,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,小哥？ 妳是不是認錯人了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.46,0:11:42.00,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,你在說什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:44.85,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,先別管那個了 今天一定要跟我決鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.85,0:11:46.23,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,竟然被發現了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.23,0:11:48.50,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,而且你這身老土的打扮是怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:49.56,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,很土嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:52.51,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個… 這其中有很複雜的原因…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.51,0:11:54.17,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,難不成你想在輸掉的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.17,0:11:57.37,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,拿「因為戴著墨鏡所以看不清楚」當藉口嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:12:00.05,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我才不會找那種迂迴的藉口！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.05,0:12:01.37,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,那就摘掉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:01.36,Top,Renji,0,0,0,,等…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.11,0:12:04.50,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,還給我！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:06.96,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,跟我對戰的話就還給你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:08.74,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哥…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.19,0:12:11.33,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.33,0:12:12.26,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.61,0:12:24.41,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.59,0:12:48.98,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,草壁同學好像沒什麼精神…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.74,0:12:51.94,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.76,0:12:57.03,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,這種時候 班長就該挺身幫助同學
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.31,0:12:59.79,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,必須幫助草壁同學才行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:01.47,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.83,0:13:02.97,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,草壁同學
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.97,0:13:05.03,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,如果妳有煩惱的話 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.53,0:13:17.65,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,那傢伙在發呆什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.65,0:13:19.31,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,這… 這個嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.82,0:13:23.82,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,原來如此 是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.82,0:13:26.12,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,不過只是稍微變裝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:28.51,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,竟然就認不出自己的哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.51,0:13:32.08,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那點我自己也覺得很扯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.56,0:13:35.88,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,因為我壓根沒想到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.88,0:13:38.08,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,跟莉莉愛的告白的人竟然是哥哥…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:39.54,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,愛的告白！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:40.34,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:44.09,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,是說 莉莉一開始就發現了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.41,0:13:46.06,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,呃… 嗯…
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.41,0:13:46.06,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Uh... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.06,0:13:49.54,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我 完全 沒 發現 唷！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.54,0:13:52.43,Comment,Aoi,0,0,0,,※ {\fnNoto Sans CJK JP}目が泳ぐ{\r}：形容人在緊張、心虛或說謊時，不敢直視對方眼睛而東張西望
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.54,0:13:52.43,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,抱歉讓妳說了這麼一個爛到眼睛都在游泳程度的謊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.43,0:13:54.72,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,也太不會掩飾了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.31,0:13:59.28,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那之後在家裡碰到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.28,0:14:02.82,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,總覺得氣氛很尷尬
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:08.36,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,話說回來 你哥為什麼要變裝啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.66,0:14:11.24,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我倒是心裡有數…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.62,0:14:16.04,Flashback,Aoi,0,0,0,,如果哥哥是那種會突然跟國中生告白的超級大變態
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:19.92,Flashback,Aoi,0,0,0,,我就要去跟爸爸商量 請他跟你斷絕父子關係喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.27,0:14:22.89,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那也可以算是一種誤會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.15,0:14:25.81,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,葵衣 瞞著妳對不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.81,0:14:28.64,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不會啦 這不是莉莉的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.11,0:14:32.77,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,話雖如此 該怎麼辦才好呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.77,0:14:34.88,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,船到橋頭自然直吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.88,0:14:36.77,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳別說得這麼輕鬆啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.77,0:14:41.55,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,不是啦 我也常常跟我姊吵到像世界末日一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.61,0:14:44.21,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,吵到像世界末日是怎樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.21,0:14:47.78,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,但過一陣子每次都船到橋頭自然直了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.27,0:14:50.32,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,兄弟姊妹就是這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.77,0:14:54.61,Text,Brother,0,0,0,,喂 快點回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.06,0:14:57.55,Text,Sister,0,0,0,,等等我啦 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.87,0:15:03.04,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這麼說來 小時候…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.87,0:15:09.96,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,吵架的時候 哥哥總是拿著遊戲過來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.96,0:15:14.90,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,說什麼「有我一個人打不贏的頭目 來幫我一下！」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.05,0:15:19.65,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不過事到如今 應該不會再這樣了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.43,0:15:22.82,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,請進
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.48,0:15:26.07,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,有我一個人打不贏的頭目
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.07,0:15:27.83,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳能來幫我嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.62,0:15:34.43,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,也不是不行啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.80,0:15:39.08,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哎呀 第一關是過了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.33,0:15:42.17,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,但第二關的頭目實在太鬼畜了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.17,0:15:45.20,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這遊戲的難度設定太奇怪了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.73,0:15:55.41,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哥哥 為什麼要變裝啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.10,0:15:58.52,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那… 那是因為…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.11,0:16:02.13,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,因為妳說要斷絕關係…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.13,0:16:05.11,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊啊 果然是因為那件事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.55,0:16:07.98,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那種話當然是開玩笑的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:09.10,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.10,0:16:12.68,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我已經從莉莉那邊聽說其中有很多誤會了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.55,0:16:15.11,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,就算撇開那件事…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.70,0:16:20.88,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我其實還是很信任哥哥的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.82,0:16:23.38,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妹妹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:26.05,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,好了啦 別這樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.05,0:16:27.09,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊 哥哥！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.09,0:16:28.13,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？ 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:30.13,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.54,0:16:33.47,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,明明就差一點了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.47,0:16:35.17,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,抱… 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.77,0:16:39.98,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不過 我要說的只有一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:41.54,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,什… 什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.46,0:16:46.17,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,你絕對不能讓莉莉傷心喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.51,0:16:47.36,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦…？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:48.42,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,知道了嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.42,0:16:50.78,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:52.73,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我知道的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.33,0:16:58.03,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,嗯 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.03,0:17:00.44,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那再挑戰一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.44,0:17:01.32,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.02,0:17:03.54,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,吵架之後…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:07.01,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,雖然我總是不知道該怎麼辦才好…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.36,0:17:16.29,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,但哥哥總是會想辦法的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.98,0:17:18.69,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,謝謝你 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:49.63,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,做得好 莉莉
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.88,0:17:49.63,Text-English,Aoi,0,0,0,,Nice. Lily-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.63,0:17:52.59,Top,Game,0,0,0,,Warning！ Warning！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.77,0:18:33.45,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.12,0:18:37.89,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,對不起 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.89,0:18:39.49,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,跨過我的屍體前…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.55,0:18:43.07,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,葵衣…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.65,0:19:04.01,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.22,0:19:50.46,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.07,0:19:55.65,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,接下來交給我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.99,0:20:05.30,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳在這裡等著
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.03,0:20:51.98,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:54.93,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我不會讓妳傷心的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.86,0:20:58.26,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮… 蓮司…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.60,0:21:01.12,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.40,0:21:02.11,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.52,0:21:04.58,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不行啦 哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.52,0:21:03.81,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.81,0:21:04.68,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,章魚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:07.77,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我跟莉莉正想挑戰一命破關耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.68,0:21:05.40,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,花枝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:06.05,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,蝦子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.05,0:21:07.86,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,蝦子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.77,0:21:11.19,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,最後才出現搶走功勞還一臉得意…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.19,0:21:12.11,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,真讓人傻眼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.11,0:21:13.13,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.13,0:21:15.50,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不… 我沒那個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.50,0:21:18.01,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我是為了莉莉才…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.01,0:21:19.80,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,對吧 葵衣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.47,0:21:22.13,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我說你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.45,0:21:24.89,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,做法太奇怪了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.86,0:21:31.50,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.50,0:21:32.81,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.39,0:21:34.69,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.69,0:21:37.23,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,什麼嘛 葵衣 妳這不是恢復精神了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.23,0:21:40.74,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,因為妳難得這麼安靜 大家都很擔心耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.74,0:21:43.90,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉 我已經恢復正常了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.90,0:21:47.33,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,太好了… 兩個人都恢復精神了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.33,0:21:50.04,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,雖然我什麼忙都沒幫上
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.04,0:21:54.17,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不過 要是一直那樣我也很難再去遊樂場了 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.41,0:21:56.84,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,遊樂場…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.06,0:22:03.42,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,難不成…
Comment: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:00.04,Default,OP,0,0,0,,-- OP --
